	<h2>About</h2>
	<p>Hi, I am André Torgal.</p>
	<p>Noodlestan is a land of dreams, experimentation, and creativity.</p>
	<p>
		For the past few years I have been keeping my favourite projects and ideas here, without any
		real plan or particular goals. Writing software because. Just because.
	</p>
	<p>Meanwhile, I decided it was time to publish everything properly.</p>
	<p>
		So I have been working towards stable, documented releases of everything listed here, and making
		the whole thing easier to discover, use, understand, and contribute to.
	</p>
